                         "stage":  "Beta",
                         "notes":  "v0.7.4 — Anti-Freeze Update (2026-04-03)\r\n\r\n  Fixed a critical issue where the device could freeze for hours when WiFi signal degraded during an SSL handshake. Clock and\r\n  battery monitoring now stay alive during glucose fetches. Migrated LVGL lock calls to prevent deadlocks. Improved alarm system\r\n  with cross-core safe deferred cleanup. LED behavior overhauled for cleaner, professional feedback. Device reboots silently after\r\n  crashes (no buzzer while sleeping). Validated with 7.5-hour overnight run: 298 fetches, zero failures, zero crashes.",
