                         "version":  "0.7.2",
                         "date":  "2026-03-31",
                         "stage":  "Beta",
                         "notes":  "v0.7.2 Beta — 2026-03-31\r\n\r\n  Fix: Socket Leak Prevention\r\n  - Added missing esp_http_client_close() calls before esp_http_client_cleanup() in all HTTP paths (Dexcom, Libre, weather, heartbeat, geocoding)\r\n  - Without proper socket close, file descriptors leaked over time, causing \"No more processes\" errors and eventual device freeze after hours of operation\r\n  - Removed unused dexcom_reopen_persistent_client() function\r\n  - Moved heartbeat from weather task to glucose task",
                         "files":  {
                                       "merged":  "firmware/v0.7.2/cygm-merged.bin",
